# Inputs and intermediates of the course build tooling (not in this tree).
# None are committed: the STEP export comes from the team Onshape account, and
# the raw USD and per-part bounds are regenerated from it.
#
# Committed (what the tasks actually load):
#   *_terrain.usd        merged single-mesh course
#   *_profile.json       height/clearance table
#   spiral_geometry.json spiral parameters
*.step
*.usd
!*_terrain.usd
*_bounds.json
*.log
hoops_config.json
